CRESET_N:
   LVCMOS 3V3 Vlo-max: 0.8V, internal pullup min. 27k 
   TLV809E: Vo-max: 0.3V
   => when driving with a resistor (to decouple from JTAG connector)
      Vccmax/(Rpu_min + R) * R < (0.8 - .3)V  (neglect Vo_max on LHS)

      Vcc/(Vlo-max - Vo-max) - 1 < Rpu_min/R

      R < Rpu_min / (Vcc/(Vlo-max - Vo-max) - 1)
